            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:25:37.950968+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b10",
            "text": "They were not issued guns at the time, but the office did have one handgun that was locked in a safe; however, there was no ammunition.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:25:37.950968+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b10-semeval-9133",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b10-semeval-9133",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9133",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
